  "description": "RestSharp-backed implementation for NetToolsKit.RestClient.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t- RestSharp-based client base classes and request pipeline.\n\t\t\t- Polly-based retry support for resilient REST calls.\n\t\t\t- JSON serialization adapters integrated with NetToolsKit.Serialization.\n\n\t\t\tIdeal for applications that want RestSharp as the HTTP engine behind NetToolsKit.RestClient.",
